  "body": "## Summary & Context\nImplements Phase F1 (P00–P02) for Lab 3, establishing the baseline verification, Sprint 3 engineering contracts, and strict test harness isolation (HARNESS-01) before running any automated mutation tests.\n\n## Scope\n- **P00 (Baseline)**: Inspected source repository, git status, environment, schema, and baseline tests.\n- **P01 (Contracts)**: Maintained and verified docs/lab-03 contracts (specification.md, \u0007pi-spec.md, ui-spec.md, \tests.md).\n- **P02 (Test Harness)**: Created server/src/harness-guard.ts to prevent test execution against development/production databases or upload paths.\n\n## Key Changes\n1. **Test Isolation Guard (server/src/harness-guard.ts)**:\n   - \u000balidateDatabaseUrl: Rejects development database \toktickit and system databases; requires dedicated test database (\toktickit_test).\n   - \u000balidateUploadDir: Prevents test file writes to uploads/ or server/uploads/, filesystem roots, or user home directory.\n   - \u000balidatePort: Verifies test port availability.\n   - TestHarnessRegistry: Deterministic registration and cleanup reporting without swallowing errors.\n   - ensureTestHarnessReady: Pre-flight assertion for all suites.\n2. **Configuration Updates**:\n   - .gitignore: Updated to ignore .env* while tracking .env.example and .env.test.example.\n   - server/vitest.config.ts: Removed silent fallback to dev .env.\n   - server/.env.test.example: Configured with isolated \toktickit_test database and test port 3103.\n   - playwright.config.ts: Added port separation (3103/5174), \reuseExistingServer: false, and explicit test environment.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria & Test Results\n- **AC-54**: Complete engineering documentation in docs/lab-03/.\n- **AC-55**: Specification and Test Plan established before implementation.\n- **HARNESS-01**: server/tests/lab-03/harness.unit.test.ts (17/17 tests passing).\n- **Baseline Regression**:\n  - server: 12 test files, 77/77 tests passing against \toktickit_test.\n  - client: 10 test files, 53/53 tests passing.\n\n## Migration Impact\nZero database migration changes in F1. Isolated PostgreSQL test database \toktickit_test provisioned and verified.\n\n## Issue Linkage\nCloses #26",
